    "sentence_translations": [
      "A Piglike Partner",
      "",
      "One day I went to the bank to withdraw money, and parked the car along the curb.",
      "Because you're not allowed to parked there, I was afraid the police might come inspect and give me a fine.",
      "So I had my friend sit in the car, and said to him to come tell me if the police were to arrive.",
      "",
      "I went inside for a few minutes, and the police actually came for inspection.",
      "My friend immediately ran into the bank, and shouted: “Brother! The police are here! Run quickly!”",
      "",
      "The bank became quiet for a few seconds, and then everyone ran outside.",
      "The bank director picked up the phone and said: “We're being robbed!”",
      "Then I was held down on the ground by six security guards.",
      "",
      "It's really more frightening to have a piglike partner than a godlike opponent."
    ]
